.TH ferry-backup-create 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-backup\-create \- Write a backup of the key, the name and the paired devices, encrypted with a password (asked for; from standard input when it is not a terminal)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry backup create\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a backup of the key, the name and the paired devices, encrypted with a password (asked for; from standard input when it is not a terminal)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
File to create; an existing file is never overwritten
